msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Kitamura「Dear Takasu Ryuuji-sama...」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Estimado Takasu Ryuuji-sama...」"

msgid "Kitamura「I'll contact you again once I get more＿details. See you! --Kitamura Yuusaku」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Te volveré a contactar cuando＿tenga más detalles. ¡Nos vemos!＿--Kitamura Yuusaku」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If you're going to start with \"Dear＿Ryuuji-sama,\" don't end it with \"see＿you\"......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si vas a empezar con \"Estimado＿Ryuuji-sama\", no lo termines＿con \"nos vemos\"......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So Kitamura's coming to Italy, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que Kitamura viene a Italia, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Once Kitamura gets here, I wonder if＿he'd like me to show him around?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Cuando llegue Kitamura, ¿le gustaría＿que le diera un recorrido?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'm sure Kawashima would say \"I want＿to see all the brand-name stores!\"）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Seguro que Kawashima diría: \"¡Quiero＿ver todas las tiendas de marca!\"）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Kawashima would say,\" huh...... Guess＿it's a force of habit......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「\"Kawashima diría\", eh...... Supongo que＿es la fuerza de la costumbre......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Kawashima......!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¡¿Kawashima......?!」"

msgid "Ami「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you Kawashima Ami?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eres Kawashima Ami?」"

msgid "Ami「......Is that...... Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Eres...... Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí!」"

msgid "Ami「Huh? What!?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eh? ¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Ami「How!? Why are you here!?」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¿Cómo?! ¡¿Por qué estás aquí?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I came here for culinary training.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vine aquí para formarme en cocina.」"

msgid "Ami「Culinary training!? No way! You're a＿real pro now!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¿Formación culinaria?! ¡No puede ser!＿¡Ya eres todo un profesional!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Likewise, what are you doing here?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Igualmente, ¿qué haces tú por aquí?」"

msgid "Ami「I'm here for work. My next movie is＿being filmed here.」"
msgstr "Ami「Estoy aquí por trabajo. Mi próxima＿película se está rodando aquí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I see. Kawashima Ami is a big-name＿actress now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ya veo. Kawashima Ami＿ya es una actriz famosa.」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu! I guess so.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Juju! Supongo que sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is this your day off?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hoy es tu día libre?」"

msgid "Ami「Yep! So I'm sightseeing. Then I'll do a＿little shopping.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Sip! Así que estoy haciendo turismo.＿Luego iré un poco de compras.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Heh. Going to all the brand-name＿stores?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Je. ¿Vas a ir a todas las＿tiendas de marca?」"

msgid "Ami「Of course...... What's with that weird＿look? Your ugly mug is creepy as ever.」"
msgstr "Ami「Por supuesto...... ¿Y esa cara＿rara? Tu cara fea da tanto＿miedo como siempre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And your rotten mouth is as＿intolerable as ever......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y esa boca venenosa tuya sigue siendo＿tan insoportable como siempre......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Actually, I was just thinking how if you＿came to Rome, you'd want to hit up all＿the brand-name stores.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De hecho, justo pensaba que si venías＿a Roma, querrías recorrer todas＿las tiendas de marca.」"

msgid "Ami「Huh? You were thinking about me?＿What a crazy coincidence.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eh? ¿Estabas pensando en mí?＿Qué coincidencia tan loca.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It wasn't a coincidence.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No fue una coincidencia.」"

msgid "Ami「What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's why I think about you at every＿opportunity so I won't forget you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por eso pienso en ti en cada＿oportunidad, para no olvidarte.」"

msgid "Ami「............Are you stupid?」"
msgstr "Ami「............¿Eres tonto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the deal!? I was just doing what＿you asked of me!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué pasa?! ¡¡Solo estaba haciendo＿lo que me pediste!!」"

msgid "Ami「But you're so stupid! That's the＿dumbest way to go about it!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Pero eres tan tonto! ¡Esa es la＿forma más absurda de hacerlo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha!? Were you lying!? But I............ Oh,＿forget it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?! ¡¿Estabas mintiendo?! Pero＿yo............ Ah, olvídalo.」"

msgid "Ami「You what?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Tú qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada.」"

msgid "Ami「..................I'm kidding.」"
msgstr "Ami「..................Es broma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「Thanks for remembering me.」"
msgstr "Ami「Gracias por recordarme.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................I admit, I thought you might＿have lied. But \"there is some truth in＿every lie,\" right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................Lo admito, pensé que＿tal vez mentiste. Pero \"en toda mentira＿hay algo de verdad\", ¿cierto?」"

msgid "Ami「You remembered that too......?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿También recordaste eso......?」"

msgid "Ami「I'm impressed, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Me impresionas, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ami「You're still as impressive as ever.＿And...... I'm kinda into that.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sigues siendo tan increíble como＿siempre. Y...... eso me atrae un poco.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「You treat me no differently, whether＿I'm two-faced or an actress.」"
msgstr "Ami「Me tratas igual, ya sea que tenga＿dos caras o que sea actriz.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, you're still you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, sigues siendo tú.」"

msgid "Ami「......So you've really always been＿thinking about me?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Entonces de verdad siempre＿estuviste pensando en mí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Sí.」"

msgid "Ami「Then......」"
msgstr "Ami「Entonces......」"

msgid "Ami「Have you been holding out for me?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Estuviste esperándome?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu...... Oh, I know! Since I'm at the＿Trevi Fountain, I gotta toss in a coin.」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju...... ¡Ah, ya sé! Ya que＿estoy en la Fontana de Trevi,＿debo lanzar una moneda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah. You're supposed to throw it＿over your shoulder. If it makes it in,＿then you'll return to Rome, they say.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí. Se supone que la lanzas＿por encima del hombro. Si entra,＿dicen que volverás a Roma.」"

msgid "Ami「Huh? Don't you know? It depends on＿the number of coins.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eh? ¿No lo sabes? Depende de＿la cantidad de monedas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Does it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「They thought up three different＿meanings for this......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Inventaron tres significados＿distintos para esto......?」"

msgid "Ami「Okay, Takasu-kun, I'm throwing two.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bien, Takasu-kun, voy a lanzar dos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Uh, what!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Eh, ¡¿qué?!」"

msgid "Ami「Come on, make it snappy. Don't get＿mugged.」"
msgstr "Ami「Vamos, date prisa. Que no te asalten.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「H-Hey!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡O-Oye!」"

msgid "Ami「One, two!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Una, dos!」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, they went in!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Oh, entraron!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡T-Tú!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Today's my day off.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hoy es mi día libre.」"

msgid "Ami「It is? What a shame. Okay, let's go＿there anyway. I want to see it.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Lo es? Qué lástima. Bueno, vamos allí＿de todos modos. Quiero verlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Jeez, fine...... Come on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cielos, está bien...... Vamos.」"

msgid "Ami「Huh? What's with your hand?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eh? ¿Y esa mano?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"When in Rome, do as the Romans do.\"＿In Italy, you're a gentleman or you're＿trash.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「\"En Roma, haz como los romanos\". En＿Italia, eres un caballero o eres basura.」"

msgid "Ami「............Hmmm. Takasu-kun, I'm glad I＿came to Italy.」"
msgstr "Ami「............Mmm. Takasu-kun, me alegro＿de haber venido a Italia.」"

msgid "Ami「Is the restaurant close by?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿El restaurante queda cerca?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's a short walk, I guess......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está a unos pasos, supongo......」"

msgid "Ami「Say, how long have you lived here?」"
msgstr "Ami「Dime, ¿cuánto tiempo llevas aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo......」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Antes que nada, quizá＿debería agradecerte por tu arduo＿trabajo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que obtuviste este final, la razón＿por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......no es otra que hablar sobre la＿ruta que elegiste. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar al respecto juntos.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, evaluemos el final＿que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, empecemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「I'm glad you were able to talk to＿Kawashima-san before she＿transferred, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Me alegro de que pudieras hablar＿con Kawashima-san antes de que se＿transfiriera, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「I don't even have a friend who I can＿grab lunch with...... Awwww～......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Yo ni siquiera tengo una amiga con quien＿ir a almorzar...... Aaaay～......」"

msgid "Yuri「Setting that aside, you still have that＿parting gift you got from＿Kawashima-san, yes?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Dejando eso de lado, aún tienes＿ese regalo de despedida que te＿dio Kawashima-san, ¿cierto?」"

msgid "Yuri「If you can make use of that, things＿might turn out much differently next＿time.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Si logras aprovecharlo, las＿cosas podrían resultar muy distintas＿la próxima vez.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now then, if I graded this ending, I'd＿give it an impressive 90 points! You＿worked hard!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora bien, si calificara este final,＿¡le daría unos impresionantes 90 puntos!＿¡Te esforzaste mucho!」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

msgid "『Music』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Música』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "『Album』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Álbum』 ya está disponible en 『Extra』"

msgid "Kitamura「How are you? As always, I'm doing＿great. I just got back to Japan from＿Mexico yesterday, so I thought I'd write」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Cómo estás? Como siempre, estoy＿genial. Ayer volví a Japón desde＿México, así que pensé en」"

msgid "Kitamura「you.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「escribirte.」"

msgid "Kitamura「I saw Yasuko-san today. She and＿Inko-chan are doing well. She told me＿all about how you send her letters」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Hoy vi a Yasuko-san. Ella e Inko-chan＿están muy bien. Me contó todo sobre＿las cartas que le mandas」"

msgid "Kitamura「from Italy every day.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「desde Italia todos los días.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Actually, we're going to stop over in＿Rome on our way to the next dig site. If＿possible, I'd like to meet you. I hope to」"
msgstr "Kitamura「La verdad es que haremos escala en Roma＿camino a la próxima excavación. Si se＿puede, me gustaría verte. Espero」"

msgid "Kitamura「enjoy the results of your culinary＿training.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「disfrutar los frutos de tu＿formación culinaria.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Haven't seen Kitamura in a long time.＿Not since we graduated high school......＿Well, we did meet once before I left for）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Hace mucho que no veo a Kitamura. Desde＿que nos graduamos...... Bueno, nos vimos＿una vez antes de irme a）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Rome.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Roma.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Nah, he's an archaeologist in the＿making, after all. Unlike Taiga, he＿wouldn't want this to turn into a）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Nah, después de todo es un arqueólogo＿en formación. A diferencia de Taiga,＿no querría convertir esto en un）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Roman Holiday remake.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（remake de Vacaciones en Roma.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Remember what you told me in high＿school? \"I don't want to be＿remembered. If you forget something」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Recuerdas lo que me dijiste en＿la preparatoria? \"No quiero que＿me recuerden. Si olvidas algo」"

msgid "Ryuuji「once, it should stay forgotten.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「una vez, debe quedar olvidado\".」"

msgid "Ami「Yeah. One coin means \"you'll return to＿Rome,\" two means \"you'll be with the＿one you love forever,\" and three means」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí. Una moneda: \"volverás a＿Roma\"; dos: \"estarás siempre＿con quien amas\"; y tres:」"

msgid "Ami「\"you'll get divorced.\"」"
msgstr "Ami「\"te divorciarás\".」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? What are you getting so＿worked up about? Oh, hey, take me to＿the restaurant where you're training. I」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quéee～? ¿Por qué te alteras tanto?＿Ah, oye, llévame al restaurante donde＿haces tus prácticas. Quiero」"

msgid "Ami「want to eat your cooking.」"
msgstr "Ami「probar tu comida.」"

msgid "Yuri「I'll come and see you every time you＿reach an ending.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Vendré a verte cada vez que＿llegues a un final.」"

msgid "Yuri「I want you to reflect on the actions you＿made this time and keep them in mind＿for next time.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Quiero que reflexiones sobre las＿decisiones que tomaste esta vez y las＿tengas en cuenta para la próxima.」"

msgid "Yuri「And then you had a fateful reunion in a＿foreign country. *Sigh*...... Oh, to be＿young again. You have so much ahead」"
msgstr "Yuri「Y tuvieron un reencuentro del destino＿en el extranjero. *Suspiro*...... Ay,＿volver a ser joven. Tienen tanto」"

msgid "Yuri「of you......」"
msgstr "Yuri「por delante......」"
